### MODEL (turn 2)
The bug is the greedy `(.+)` in `_BOLD`, which spans from the first `**` to the last. I'll make it non-greedy, add a regression test for two bold phrases, and rerun the suite.
[tool call luau]
print(edit("wiki/inline.py", '_BOLD = re.compile(r"\\*\\*(.+)\\*\\*")', '_BOLD = re.compile(r"\\*\\*(.+?)\\*\\*")'))
print(edit("tests/test_wiki.py", '        self.assertIn("<code>x*y*</code>", out)\n', '        self.assertIn("<code>x*y*</code>", out)\n        self.assertIn("<strong>a</strong> and <strong>b</strong>", convert("**a** and **b**"))\n'))
print(sh("python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t . 2>&1 | tail -5").stdout)
